// ── the Gatelands apothecary as a room, copied from docs/prototypes/levelup/rooms.js (Session 1876, card F9; Michael's A on #303 and on
// the kit in every interior; OG-043, OG-133), with the forge's renames (mats() → roomMats(), GL_PLANS → PLANS, gatelandsBuilding → building,
