// game passes the street's, so the shell inside is the one outside); with it the shell hangs no mortar sign, as the street hangs its own
// named board. The prototype's comment follows. ──
// the prototype's gatelandsApothecary(o, r) (Session 936, card F9; L5's interiors by nation, OG-043's Gatelands alchemy shop of herbs, potions and
//   draughts, OG-133's alchemist's room and its four steps; Michael's A on #303): the Gatelands cottage of GL_PLANS, painted green, with
